@startuml U31_components
!include style.iuml
title U31 — Services and events (component, final: Sprint 7)
actor User
node "web (nginx)" as web
component gateway
component auth
component designer
component verifier
component simulator
component deployer
component "engine.<pathway>.v<n>" as engine
component "worklist\n(+ monitor, alerts)" as worklist
component patient
component ml
component scores
queue "RabbitMQ\ncare.events" as mq
database "PostgreSQL\n(schema per service)" as db
cloud "SMTP server /\nSMS gateway" as notify
component "Prometheus\n(profile: monitoring)" as prom

User --> web
web --> gateway : REST
gateway --> auth : REST
gateway --> designer : REST
gateway --> simulator : REST
gateway --> deployer : REST
gateway --> worklist : REST
gateway --> patient : REST
note right of gateway : asks every service for\n/health and /metrics.json (MON-03)
designer --> verifier : POST /verify
simulator --> designer : GET /versions/{id}
deployer ..> engine : Docker Engine API\nstart / drain / stop
patient --> mq : PatientRegistered
engine <--> mq : TaskRequested / TaskCompleted\nTaskFailed, Case*, <emit>
worklist <--> mq : human tasks, escalations;\nmonitor queue bound to # (MON-01)
patient <--> mq : BedService (PAT-02)
ml <--> mq : PredictUrgency (ML-02)
scores <--> mq : News2Score (CLN-04)
worklist --> notify : email / SMS (WRK-03)
prom ..> gateway : scrape /metrics
auth --> db
designer --> db
simulator --> db
deployer --> db
engine --> db
worklist --> db
patient --> db : name, birth date\nencrypted (NFR-SEC-05)
note bottom of scores
  Added in Sprint 7 without any change to the
  engine: a task names its service, the engine
  publishes TaskRequested.<service> (NFR-MNT-03).
end note
@enduml
